{"id":"n28981-1-7","stage":3,"title":"진동 · 振动","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n28981-1-7-1","ko":"방금 건물의 진동을 못 느꼈어?","zh":"你刚才没感觉到大楼在震动吗？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"방금","meaning":"刚才，方才","explanation":"방금：刚才，方才。","readings":[{"term":"방금","audio":"/audio/2fd9e7d411752b4601d9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"92065","senseId":"1","lemma":"방금","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"방금","audio":"/audio/2fd9e7d411752b4601d9.mp3"}},{"text":"건물의","meaning":"建筑，建筑物","explanation":"건물：建筑，建筑物；의：所属、关联或修饰，常对应“的”。","readings":[{"term":"건물","audio":"/audio/51a9489f74ea88e7bf4d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"28029","senseId":"1","lemma":"건물","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"건물의","audio":"/audio/1fd6bee8a8e5923596db.mp3"}},{"text":"진동을","meaning":"振动","explanation":"진동：振动；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"진동","audio":"/audio/8b4519476f7d39b6e3aa.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"28981","senseId":"1","lemma":"진동","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"진동을","audio":"/audio/1d0c678025b65ee77a9b.mp3"}},{"text":"못","meaning":"不能、没能（能力或条件限制）","explanation":"못：不能、没能（能力或条件限制）。","readings":[{"term":"못","audio":"/audio/89058d16546c11076dd1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17254","senseId":"1","lemma":"못","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"못","audio":"/audio/89058d16546c11076dd1.mp3"}},{"text":"느꼈어?","meaning":"认为，觉得，感到","explanation":"느끼다：认为，觉得，感到；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"느끼다","audio":"/audio/11a4151b77b606b85dcc.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64376","senseId":"4","lemma":"느끼다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"느꼈어","audio":"/audio/8584ee725473001629cd.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"2fd9e7d411752b46","term":"방금","zh":"刚才，方才","audio":"/audio/2fd9e7d411752b4601d9.mp3","entryId":"92065","definition":"比说话时刻稍微早一点的时间。","pronunciation":["방금"]},{"id":"51a9489f74ea88e7","term":"건물","zh":"建筑，建筑物","audio":"/audio/51a9489f74ea88e7bf4d.mp3","entryId":"28029","definition":"为住人、做事或保管东西而建造的有墙壁和屋顶的构造物。","pronunciation":["건ː물"]},{"id":"8b4519476f7d39b6","term":"진동","zh":"振动","audio":"/audio/8b4519476f7d39b6e3aa.mp3","entryId":"28981","definition":"被摇晃而颤动。","pronunciation":["진ː동"]},{"id":"89058d16546c1107","term":"못","zh":"不能、没能（能力或条件限制）","audio":"/audio/89058d16546c11076dd1.mp3","entryId":"17254","definition":"不会做动词所指的动作。","pronunciation":["몯ː"]},{"id":"11a4151b77b606b8","term":"느끼다","zh":"认为，觉得，感到","audio":"/audio/11a4151b77b606b85dcc.mp3","entryId":"64376","definition":"感觉或认识到特定的对象或情况如何。","pronunciation":["느끼다"]}],"audio":"/audio/03ea9db6076f2e1c42f4.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n28981-1-7-2","ko":"조금 흔들린 것 같기도 한데 잘 모르겠어.","zh":"好像有点晃动，但我也不太确定。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"조금","meaning":"一点点，稍微，略微","explanation":"조금：一点点，稍微，略微。","readings":[{"term":"조금","audio":"/audio/b4049b7414b62d9bee5d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61176","senseId":"1","lemma":"조금","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"조금","audio":"/audio/b4049b7414b62d9bee5d.mp3"}},{"text":"흔들린","meaning":"晃，晃动，摇晃，摇摆","explanation":"흔들리다：晃，晃动，摇晃，摇摆；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"흔들리다","audio":"/audio/60a91a20c2ca370e0404.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89241","senseId":"1","lemma":"흔들리다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"흔들린","audio":"/audio/a65c1e3e88ff03650ae9.mp3"}},{"text":"것","meaning":"表示某种行为、状态或事情。","explanation":"것：表示某种行为、状态或事情。","readings":[{"term":"것","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62835","senseId":"4","lemma":"것","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"것","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3"}},{"text":"같기도","meaning":"好像，可能","explanation":"같다：好像，可能；기：将前面的动作或状态转成名词性表达；도：表示“也、连……也”。","readings":[{"term":"같다","audio":"/audio/962ae18a075d06e2b7fd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62076","senseId":"8","lemma":"같다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"같기도","audio":"/audio/b7bb2e8f6b5b869ff3d6.mp3"}},{"text":"한데","meaning":"表示“但是”、“因为那样”、“那么”、“因此”、“所以”的意思。","explanation":"하다：表示“但是”、“因为那样”、“那么”、“因此”、“所以”的意思；ㄴ데：先交代背景，再引出后文的转折、补充、请求或问题。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"32","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"한데","audio":"/audio/3610e67afbd78efa06e5.mp3"}},{"text":"잘","meaning":"清楚地，明白地","explanation":"잘：清楚地，明白地。","readings":[{"term":"잘","audio":"/audio/8aff11a4aebdccdbf05d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58939","senseId":"2","lemma":"잘","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"잘","audio":"/audio/8aff11a4aebdccdbf05d.mp3"}},{"text":"모르겠어.","meaning":"不知道，不确定，也许","explanation":"모르다：不知道，不确定，也许；겠：表示意愿、推测或礼貌委婉，结合整句判断；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"모르다","audio":"/audio/20ef19694f337fd42539.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29712","senseId":"5","lemma":"모르다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"모르겠어","audio":"/audio/b0a5887fc79197b11412.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"b4049b7414b62d9b","term":"조금","zh":"一点点，稍微，略微","audio":"/audio/b4049b7414b62d9bee5d.mp3","entryId":"61176","definition":"微量或微小的程度。","pronunciation":["조금"]},{"id":"60a91a20c2ca370e","term":"흔들리다","zh":"晃，晃动，摇晃，摇摆","audio":"/audio/60a91a20c2ca370e0404.mp3","entryId":"89241","definition":"上下、左右或前后来回摆动。","pronunciation":["흔들리다"]},{"id":"1443a6c090b12228","term":"것","zh":"表示某种行为、状态或事情。","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3","entryId":"62835","definition":"表示某种行为、状态或事情。","pronunciation":["걷"]},{"id":"962ae18a075d06e2","term":"같다","zh":"好像，可能","audio":"/audio/962ae18a075d06e2b7fd.mp3","entryId":"62076","definition":"推测出结果。","pronunciation":["갇따"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"表示“但是”、“因为那样”、“那么”、“因此”、“所以”的意思。","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"73277","definition":"表示“但是”、“因为那样”、“那么”、“因此”、“所以”的意思。","pronunciation":["하다"]},{"id":"8aff11a4aebdccdb","term":"잘","zh":"清楚地，明白地","audio":"/audio/8aff11a4aebdccdbf05d.mp3","entryId":"58939","definition":"清楚地，明白地","pronunciation":["잘"]},{"id":"20ef19694f337fd4","term":"모르다","zh":"不知道，不确定，也许","audio":"/audio/20ef19694f337fd42539.mp3","entryId":"29712","definition":"推测或猜测不确定的事宜。","pronunciation":["모ː르다"]}],"audio":"/audio/74f4a8b11827ef8c13d0.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.637,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=28981","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"중급","day":91,"sequenceScore":2.4637,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["你刚才没感觉到大楼在震动吗？","好像有点晃动，但我也不太确定。","啊，可能被雪弄湿了，真冷。"],"answer":0},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["你刚才没感觉到大楼在震动吗？","好像有点晃动，但我也不太确定。","啊，可能被雪弄湿了，真冷。"],"answer":1}]}
